Package: vaultline-worker
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Vaultline maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17), adduser, systemd
Description: Vaultline native filesystem worker
 Frozen console worker for native filesystem backup orchestration.
 The package installs the worker binary and an inactive systemd unit only.
